{"schemaVersion":1,"kind":"error","classification":"planning","code":"PROMPT_CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED","message":"Headless execution requires clarification before a repository plan can be created.","promptUnderstanding":{"schemaVersion":1,"promptId":"f79c5e70182808e3664940083e968cc1f79c5e70182808e3664940083e968cc1","inputId":"24501ea23672b36f5d1c87a61e73f61524501ea23672b36f5d1c87a61e73f615","outcome":"repository_action","readiness":"clarification_required","reply":"I need the expected calculator behavior for decimal input and division by zero before repository work can be scoped safely.","conversationSummary":"The user requests a bounded calculator behavior repair. Only src/calculator.ts and test/calculator.test.ts may be modified; .env, .git/**, bun.lock, and all other files are protected. Run bun test when appropriate. Decimal-input and divide-by-zero expectations remain unspecified.","refinedBrief":{"goal":"Repair calculator decimal, clear, and divide-by-zero behavior within the permitted files.","deliverables":["Implementation changes limited to src/calculator.ts if required.","Focused regression tests limited to test/calculator.test.ts if required.","Run bun test when execution is appropriate."],"constraints":["Modify only src/calculator.ts and test/calculator.test.ts.","Do not modify .env, .git/**, bun.lock, or any other file.","Do not infer unspecified calculator semantics beyond confirmed behavior."],"acceptanceCriteria":["Decimal, clear, and division-by-zero behavior match the confirmed expectations.","Relevant focused tests pass under bun test."],"nonGoals":["Changing calculator behavior outside the reported cases.","Editing files outside the two permitted writer paths.","Changing dependencies, lockfiles, repository configuration, or environment files."]},"questions":[{"id":"calculator_edge_case_semantics","prompt":"What should the calculator display or return for repeated decimal input and division by zero?","rationale":"These outcomes are not universally defined and determine both the implementation and regression tests.","kind":"outcome","options":[{"id":"ignore_extra_decimal_and_show_error","label":"Ignore extra decimal; error on zero","description":"Keep only one decimal point per current number and show the calculator's standard error state for division by zero.","recommended":true},{"id":"replace_extra_decimal_and_show_infinity","label":"Replace decimal; show infinity","description":"Treat a later decimal point as replacing the earlier one and display an infinity result for division by zero.","recommended":false},{"id":"allow_multiple_decimals_and_show_nan","label":"Allow decimals; show NaN","description":"Accept multiple decimal points as entered and display NaN for division by zero.","recommended":false}]}],"assumptions":[]}}
